WEBVTT

00:19:28.526 --> 00:19:34.098
by losing ourselves
in our Blackberries, our iPhones,

00:19:34.122 --> 00:19:38.984
by not paying attention
to the human being across from us

00:19:39.008 --> 00:19:40.559
who is talking with us,

00:19:40.583 --> 00:19:45.265
by being so lazy that we're not
willing to process deeply?

00:19:47.463 --> 00:19:49.183
I learned firsthand

00:19:49.207 --> 00:19:52.676
that there are incredible
memory capacities

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:54.716
latent in all of us.

00:19:55.359 --> 00:19:58.182
But if you want to live a memorable life,

00:19:58.206 --> 00:20:00.515
you have to be the kind of person